{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16973","headline":"送田三端公还鄂州 · 武元衡","name":"送田三端公还鄂州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤云迢遰恋沧洲，劝酒梨花对白头。\n南陌送归车骑合，东城怨别管弦愁。\n青油幕里人如玉，黄鹤楼中月并钩。\n君去庾公应借问，驰心千里大江流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}